{number: 46}
{title: There Is Power in the Blood}
{key: Bb}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[Bb] Would you be free from the burden of sin?
There's [Eb] power in the blood, [Bb] power in the [F7] blood;
[Bb] Would you o'er evil a victory win?
There's [Eb] wonderful [F7] power in the [Bb] blood.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
There is [Bb] power, power, wonder-working power
In the [Eb] blood of the [Bb] Lamb;
There is [Bb] power, power, wonder-working power
In the [F7] precious blood of the [Bb] Lamb.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: 2}
[Bb] Would you be free from your passion and pride?
There's [Eb] power in the blood, [Bb] power in the [F7] blood;
[Bb] Come for a cleansing to Calvary's tide;
There's [Eb] wonderful [F7] power in the [Bb] blood.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
[Bb] Would you be whiter, much whiter than snow?
There's [Eb] power in the blood, [Bb] power in the [F7] blood;
[Bb] Sin stains are lost in its life-giving flow;
There's [Eb] wonderful [F7] power in the [Bb] blood.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
[Bb] Would you do service for Jesus your King?
There's [Eb] power in the blood, [Bb] power in the [F7] blood;
[Bb] Would you live daily His praises to sing?
There's [Eb] wonderful [F7] power in the [Bb] blood.
{end_of_verse}
